# Crossroads_06 (the room left of the False Knight's cave): in at the right on the floor, left along the tunnel and up the
# shaft's ledges, over the upper passages and back along the top platform to the Ancestral Mound's door (x 28.4, y 29.7).
# Written by a route planner over the room's own collision edges and the guest's own Player::step (a search over walk, drop
# and jump actions; every jump is kept only when a take-off a sixth of a unit either side still lands on the same floor),
# then proved on the disc: nothing in this room needs a fight or a pickup.
at 59.5 3.4
